# 文本归一：仓库内统一 LF，Windows 脚本保留 CRLF
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不做行尾转换、不参与文本 diff
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.lib binary
*.a binary
*.bin binary
*.hex binary
*.elf binary
*.axf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.mp4 binary
